{"title":"Subject Classes","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a> <b>subject classes</b> cover topics in mathematics including topics covered in the ordinary middle and high school math track as well as topics outside of standard curriculum.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Levels_of_subject_classes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Levels of subject classes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Subject_Classes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Subject Classes</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Introductory\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Introductory</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Intermediate\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Intermediate</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Class_Information\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Class Information</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Beyond_Intermediate\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Beyond Intermediate</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Levels_of_subject_classes\">Levels of subject classes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Subject_Classes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Levels of subject classes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Introductory (at the level of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10\" title=\"AMC 10\">AMC 10</a>, and much of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12\" title=\"AMC 12\">AMC 12</a>).</li>\n<li>Intermediate (at the level of hardest <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12\" title=\"AMC 12\">AMC 12</a> problems, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AIME\">AIME</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ARML\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ARML\">ARML</a>, and the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mandelbrot_Competition\" title=\"Mandelbrot Competition\">Mandelbrot Competition</a>).</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Subject_Classes\">Subject Classes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Subject_Classes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Subject Classes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Introductory\">Introductory</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Subject_Classes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Introductory\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Introduction_to_Counting_%26_Probability_Course&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Introduction to Counting &amp; Probability Course (page does not exist)\">Introduction to Counting &amp; Probability Course</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Classes/AoPS_C_ClassesS.php#begcount\">Details</a> (Course follows a <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Books/AoPS_B_Item.php?page_id=3\">companion text</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Introduction_to_Number_Theory_Course&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Introduction to Number Theory Course (page does not exist)\">Introduction to Number Theory Course</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Classes/AoPS_C_ClassesS.php#begnum\">Details</a> (Course will begin following the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Books/AoPS_B_Item.php?page_id=10\">companion text</a> during its next offering)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Introduction_to_Geometry_Course&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Introduction to Geometry Course (page does not exist)\">Introduction to Geometry Course</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Classes/AoPS_C_ClassesS.php#beggeom\">Details</a> (Course follows a <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Books/AoPS_B_Item.php?page_id=9\">companion text</a>)</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Intermediate\">Intermediate</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Subject_Classes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Intermediate\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Intermediate_Algebra_Course&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Intermediate Algebra Course (page does not exist)\">Intermediate Algebra Course</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Classes/AoPS_C_ClassesS.php#intalg\">Details</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Intermediate_Trigonometry/Complex_Numbers_Course&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Intermediate Trigonometry/Complex Numbers Course (page does not exist)\">Intermediate Trigonometry/Complex Numbers Course</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Classes/AoPS_C_ClassesS.php#inttrig\">Details</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Intermediate_Number_Theory_Course&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Intermediate Number Theory Course (page does not exist)\">Intermediate Number Theory Course</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Classes/AoPS_C_ClassesS.php#intermnum\">Details</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Intermediate_Counting_%26_Probability_Course&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Intermediate Counting &amp; Probability Course (page does not exist)\">Intermediate Counting &amp; Probability Course</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Classes/AoPS_C_ClassesS.php#begcount\">Details</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Class_Information\">Class Information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Subject_Classes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Class Information\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Classes/AoPS_C_About.php\">About the AoPS Online School</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Classes/AoPS_C_Enroll.php\">Enrollment Information</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Classes/AoPS_C_Testimonial.php\">Testimonials</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Classes/AoPS_C_FAQ.php\">FAQ</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Beyond_Intermediate\">Beyond Intermediate</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Subject_Classes&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Beyond Intermediate\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Worldwide_Online_Olympiad_Training\" title=\"Worldwide Online Olympiad Training\">Worldwide Online Olympiad Training</a> (WOOT) program offers students an opportunity to study topics beyond even advanced high school level curriculum while learning to write rigorous proofs.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017212429\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.131 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 32/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3269:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017212429 and revision id 7346. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}